Filter(((customer_id) IN (subquery) AND EXISTS(subquery)) AND (amount > SCALAR(subquery)))
├─ subquery (customer_id) IN (subquery)
│  └─ Project(id)
│     └─ Scan(vip)
├─ subquery EXISTS(subquery)
│  └─ Filter(active = TRUE)
│     └─ Scan(flags)
├─ subquery SCALAR(subquery)
│  └─ Aggregate(`avg(amount)` = avg(amount))
│     └─ Scan(orders)
└─ Scan(orders)
